window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-4cce5c605af6674d"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"write-an-initiative-off-track-brief\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"_1\">撰写项目偏离计划简报</h1> <p>说明项目进度为何偏离、发生了什么变化，以及需要作出什么决定。</p> <p>向 ChatGPT 提供管理层要求、项目文档、KPI 仪表板、跟踪表、财务模型、会议笔记、利益相关者讨论串和负责人更新，请它起草一份适合管理层阅读的项目偏离计划简报。</p> <p><a id=\"best-for\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">适合哪些情况</h2> <ul> <li>进度落后、需要基于证据说明原因的战略项目。</li> <li>需要清楚呈现备选方案、权衡、负责人和决策请求的管理层评审。</li> <li>需要协调跟踪表状态、KPI、财务和利益相关者背景的团队。</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"skills-plugins\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">技能与插件</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>技能或插件</th> <th>用途</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/google-drive\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">google-drive（需联网）</a></td> <td>阅读项目计划、跟踪表、模型和获准使用的来源文档。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/slack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">slack（需联网）</a></td> <td>查看与项目相关的利益相关者讨论串、负责人更新和决策。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>$spreadsheets</code></td> <td>验证 KPI 变化、财务假设和跟踪表数据。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>$documents</code></td> <td>撰写包含备选方案、权衡和决策请求的简明简报。</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p><a id=\"starter-prompt\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_4\">起步提示词</h2> <p>起草项目偏离计划简报</p> <p>建议推理级别：<code>medium</code></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">为 [initiative] 起草一份项目偏离计划简报。\n\n使用我提供的管理层要求、项目文档、KPI 仪表板、项目跟踪表、财务模型、会议笔记、利益相关者讨论串和负责人更新。\n\n说明发生了什么变化、可能原因、执行方面的差距、风险、备选方案、权衡、负责人和需要作出的决定。将已确认的证据与假设分开，为重要数字标出来源，并指出需要负责人确认的内容。不要修改跟踪表或发送简报。\n</code></pre> <p><a id=\"related-links\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_5\">关联文档</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://openai.com/academy/codex-for-work/how-business-operations-teams-use-codex/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenAI Academy：业务运营团队（需联网）</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/codex/use-cases/verified-operations-workflows\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">执行经过核实的运营工作流（需联网）</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>如需完整文档索引，请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在文档页面 URL 末尾添加 <code>.md</code>，即可获取该页面的 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"reconcile-the-plan-with-execution-signals\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_6\">对照执行信号，找出偏差</h2> <p>项目偏离计划简报应说明计划与当前实际情况之间的差距。向 ChatGPT 提供管理层的要求、项目计划、跟踪表、KPI 和财务背景、负责人更新以及利益相关者讨论，让它把解释与证据对应起来。</p> <ol> <li>明确项目、简报读者、决策日期和范围。</li> <li>附上计划、跟踪表、仪表板、模型、笔记、讨论串和负责人更新。</li> <li>要求 ChatGPT 列出发生变化的假设、执行差距、风险和缺失输入。</li> <li>使用起始提示词，并检查其中的方案、权衡、负责人和决策请求。</li> <li>更改计划或项目状态之前，与项目负责人审核建议。</li> </ol> <p>将可能的原因与已经确认的原因分开。管理者应能看出现在需要作出什么决定，以及哪些新增证据会改变建议。</p> <p><a id=\"prepare-the-decision-conversation\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_7\">准备决策会议</h2> <p>后续可以将简报整理成简短的会前阅读材料，只保留需要讨论的关键决策和问题。</p> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Turn the off-track brief into a decision meeting pre-read.\n\nInclude:\n\n- the one-sentence situation\n- evidence of what changed\n- decision needed now\n- options and tradeoffs\n- risks and owners\n- unresolved questions\n- source links and missing inputs\n\nDo not imply approval or update the initiative tracker.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">请将这份项目偏离计划简报整理成决策会议的会前阅读材料。\n\n包括：\n\n- 用一句话概括当前情况\n- 说明发生了哪些变化的证据\n- 现在需要作出的决定\n- 可选方案及其权衡\n- 风险和负责人\n- 尚未解决的问题\n- 来源链接和缺失的输入\n\n不要暗示已经获得批准，也不要更新项目跟踪表。</div></div>","en":"<h1 id=\"write-an-initiative-off-track-brief\">Write an initiative off-track brief</h1> <p>Explain what changed, why an initiative slipped, and what decision is needed.</p> <p>Give ChatGPT the executive ask, initiative docs, KPI dashboards, tracker, financial model, meeting notes, stakeholder threads, and owner updates, then ask it to draft an executive-ready off-track brief.</p> <h2 id=\"best-for\">Best for</h2> <ul> <li>Strategic initiatives that are slipping and need an evidence-backed explanation.</li> <li>Leadership reviews where options, tradeoffs, owners, and a decision ask must be clear.</li> <li>Teams reconciling tracker status with KPI, financial, and stakeholder context.</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"skills-plugins\">Skills &amp; Plugins</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>Skill or plugin</th> <th>Why use it</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/google-drive\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">google-drive (online)</a></td> <td>Read initiative plans, trackers, models, and approved source documents.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/slack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">slack (online)</a></td> <td>Review stakeholder threads, owner updates, and decisions around the initiative.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>$spreadsheets</code></td> <td>Validate KPI movement, financial assumptions, and tracker data.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>$documents</code></td> <td>Create a concise brief with options, tradeoffs, and a decision ask.</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <h2 id=\"starter-prompt\">Starter prompt</h2> <p>Draft the off-track brief</p> <p>Suggested reasoning effort：<code>medium</code></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Draft an off-track brief for [initiative].\n\nUse the executive ask, initiative docs, KPI dashboards, project tracker, financial model, meeting notes, stakeholder threads, and owner updates I provide.\n\nExplain what changed, likely causes, execution gaps, risks, options, tradeoffs, owners, and the decision needed. Separate confirmed evidence from hypotheses, cite the source behind material numbers, and flag anything that needs owner confirmation. Do not change the tracker or send the brief.\n</code></pre> <h2 id=\"related-links\">Related links</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://openai.com/academy/codex-for-work/how-business-operations-teams-use-codex/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenAI Academy: Business operations teams (online)</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/codex/use-cases/verified-operations-workflows\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Run verified operations (online)</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"reconcile-the-plan-with-execution-signals\">Reconcile the plan with execution signals</h2> <p>An off-track brief should explain a gap between the plan and current reality. Give ChatGPT the executive ask, initiative plan, tracker, KPI and financial context, owner updates, and stakeholder discussion so it can trace the explanation to evidence.</p> <ol> <li>Define the initiative, audience, decision date, and scope of the brief.</li> <li>Attach the plan, tracker, dashboards, model, notes, threads, and owner updates.</li> <li>Ask ChatGPT to list changed assumptions, execution gaps, risks, and missing inputs.</li> <li>Run the starter prompt and inspect the options, tradeoffs, owners, and decision ask.</li> <li>Review the recommendation with initiative owners before changing plans or status.</li> </ol> <p>Keep likely causes separate from confirmed causes. Leaders should be able to see which decision is needed now and which additional evidence would change the recommendation.</p> <h2 id=\"prepare-the-decision-conversation\">Prepare the decision conversation</h2> <p>Use a follow-up to turn the brief into a short meeting pre-read with the smallest set of decisions and questions that need discussion.</p> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Turn the off-track brief into a decision meeting pre-read.\n\nInclude:\n\n- the one-sentence situation\n- evidence of what changed\n- decision needed now\n- options and tradeoffs\n- risks and owners\n- unresolved questions\n- source links and missing inputs\n\nDo not imply approval or update the initiative tracker.\n</code></pre>"};
